WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:05.340
Today we will communicate ideas through body movement. Our work connects with other

00:00:05.340 --> 00:00:06.131
Ghanaian communities.

00:00:06.950 --> 00:00:10.193
Choose a character and identify one important action.

00:00:11.033 --> 00:00:14.383
Try three gestures that communicate the action without words.

00:00:15.200 --> 00:00:19.798
Show your gesture sequence while a friend identifies the story. Compare your result

00:00:19.798 --> 00:00:21.920
with a second example from Ghana.
